  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 103.67 Year-round resident",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 103.67 “Year-round resident” means an individual who lives in a residence served by the water system for greater than 6 months out of the year.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Dw 100) #10606, eff 6-1-14; renumbered by #10770 (from Env-Dw 103.65); renumbered by #12180 (from Env-Dw 103.66)",
